# Installed copy

The user runs `%LOCALAPPDATA%\ExoLauncher\app\ExoLauncher.exe`. After host or UI changes: `dotnet publish` (self-contained x64), swap `app.incoming-dev` → `app`, then live-test. Do not stop at repo tests.

Steam install/update/uninstall goes through `ExoLauncher.SteamIpc`. Success is ACF `BytesDownloaded` moving, not a click on Steam chrome.
